========================================
🚦 HTTP Status Codes - Quick Revision
========================================

✅ Success
----------------------------------------
200 OK           → Request successful (default GET)
201 Created      → Resource created successfully (after POST)
204 No Content   → Request successful, but no data to return (after DELETE)

🔄 Redirection
----------------------------------------
301 Moved Permanently → Resource has a new URL
302 Found             → Temporary redirect
304 Not Modified      → Use cached data (no need to resend)

⚠️ Client Errors
----------------------------------------
400 Bad Request    → Invalid request data (missing fields, wrong format)
401 Unauthorized   → No valid authentication (missing/invalid token)
403 Forbidden      → Authenticated but not allowed (no permission)
404 Not Found      → Resource doesn’t exist
409 Conflict       → Resource conflict (e.g., duplicate email on signup)

💥 Server Errors
----------------------------------------
500 Internal Server Error → Generic server failure
502 Bad Gateway           → Proxy got invalid response
503 Service Unavailable   → Server temporarily down/overloaded

========================================
 Memory Tip
========================================
200s = Success
300s = Redirect/Cache
400s = Client mistakes
500s = Server mistakes
